 ## rates
 
 - `rates.quote(weight_kg, zone)`: price for a weight and zone
+
+## vouchers
+
+- `vouchers.issue_voucher(customer_id, amount)`: issue a goodwill voucher to an existing customer and return the new `Voucher` (`amount` is `Money`, `issued_at` set to now). `amount` may be `Money` or a dollar amount (int, str, Decimal, float); it must be greater than zero and at most `settings.VOUCHER_MAX_AMOUNT` (150.00), rounded half-up to the cent. Not idempotent: each call creates a new voucher. Emits `voucher.issued`.
+  - `E_UNKNOWN_CUSTOMER`: no customer with `customer_id`
+  - `E_BAD_INPUT`: `amount` is not a number, or is zero or negative
+  - `E_LIMIT`: `amount` exceeds `settings.VOUCHER_MAX_AMOUNT` (150.00)
